I load `profileIndex` once into a local and split the null and bounds checks so the index load can be scheduled early while keeping the common valid path as the fallthrough.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetNum(void) const
{
    const auto* p = profile;
    const auto index = profileIndex;
    if (__builtin_expect(p == NULL, 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;
    if (__builtin_expect(index >= p->numFields, 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;
    return p->fields[index].num;
}
```